      "seed": 1820667837,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 197673085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785445652554,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. RegistrationView\nBottone Registrati:\nEvento: SignupWithEmailEvent(name, email, password)\nStato prima: AuthLoading\nUse case: SignupWithEmail\nSe Supabase crea già anche la sessione:\nStato: AuthAuthenticated(user)\nSe Supabase richiede conferma email:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending\nViene salvata localmente l’email pendente.\nIl router porta alla pagina verifica email.\nSe fallisce:\nStato: AuthError(message)\nCatena:\nRegistrationView -> SignupWithEmailEvent -> AuthBloc -> SignupWithEmail ->\n AuthRepository.signupWithEmail -> AuthRemoteDataSource.signupWithEmail -> supabase.auth.signUp",
      "fontSize": 21.676191711425794,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. RegistrationView\nBottone Registrati:\nEvento: SignupWithEmailEvent(name, email, password)\nStato prima: AuthLoading\nUse case: SignupWithEmail\nSe Supabase crea già anche la sessione:\nStato: AuthAuthenticated(user)\nSe Supabase richiede conferma email:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending\nViene salvata localmente l’email pendente.\nIl router porta alla pagina verifica email.\nSe fallisce:\nStato: AuthError(message)\nCatena:\nRegistrationView -> SignupWithEmailEvent -> AuthBloc -> SignupWithEmail ->\n AuthRepository.signupWithEmail -> AuthRemoteDataSource.signupWithEmail -> supabase.auth.signUp",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
