    {
      "id": "VvlaNSiimkewMKiFy7cRu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3420.2993808174233,
      "y": -4040.143575218901,
      "width": 1171.7994384765625,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1283475357,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 1359191165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785445733705,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. EmailVerificationPage\nQuesta pagina usa due cose:\nAuthBloc per la logica auth.\nEmailVerificationTimerCubit per il countdown.\nIl timer:\nStato: EmailVerificationTimerState(secondsRemaining)\nNon chiama use case.\nServe solo per abilitare/disabilitare “Invia un’altra email”.\nBottone Invia un’altra email:\nEvento: ResendConfirmationEmailEvent(email)\nStato prima: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: resending)\nUse case: ResendConfirmationEmail\nSe va bene:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: resent, message: 'Email inviata di nuovo.')\nIl timer viene riavviato.\nSe fallisce:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: error, message: failure.message)\nCatena:\nEmailVerificationPage -> ResendConfirmationEmailEvent -> AuthBloc ->\n ResendConfirmationEmail -> AuthRepository.resendConfirmationEmail ->\n AuthRemoteDataSource.resendConfirmationEmail -> supabase.auth.resend",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. EmailVerificationPage\nQuesta pagina usa due cose:\nAuthBloc per la logica auth.\nEmailVerificationTimerCubit per il countdown.\nIl timer:\nStato: EmailVerificationTimerState(secondsRemaining)\nNon chiama use case.\nServe solo per abilitare/disabilitare “Invia un’altra email”.\nBottone Invia un’altra email:\nEvento: ResendConfirmationEmailEvent(email)\nStato prima: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: resending)\nUse case: ResendConfirmationEmail\nSe va bene:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: resent, message: 'Email inviata di nuovo.')\nIl timer viene riavviato.\nSe fallisce:\nStato: AuthEmailVerificationPending(status: error, message: failure.message)\nCatena:\nEmailVerificationPage -> ResendConfirmationEmailEvent -> AuthBloc ->\n ResendConfirmationEmail -> AuthRepository.resendConfirmationEmail ->\n AuthRemoteDataSource.resendConfirmationEmail -> supabase.auth.resend",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
